The creator payload accepted any featured href starting with "/", so "//other.site/apply" or "/\other.site" from the
creator API would render on eduwit.in/c/<handle> as a link that opens another site. The schema now uses the same
isLocalPath rule as redirects and sign-in; an invalid payload already falls back to the neutral page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N9g7Xn7RWKaJF173G8V173
